# The baselines are reproduced, not carried.
#
# `history/` is restored from this repository's own history by
# `verify/extract-history-baselines.mjs` — the pixels are already in the object
# store, so carrying a second copy of them would only add weight.
#
# `reference/` is captured from the deployed MVP by `verify/capture-baselines.mjs`.
#
# Both are rebuilt by `node verify/prepare-baselines.mjs`. Their manifests ARE
# tracked: the manifest is the record of what the baseline set is.
reference/*.png
history/*.png
history/shots/
diffs/
